__pycache__/ 
*.pyc
Thumbs.db
output/
ml-output/


# When running a python script, Python compiles it into bytecode(.pyc) for faster future runs. These files get stored in __pycache__/. They aremachine gerated and not part of source code
# .pyc ignores all python compiled files
# Thumbs.db - created by Windows and stored thumbnail cache for images/videos in a folder 
# Ignore output folder


